%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S12_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: Ahem. Just one last thing before we go.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, back to business I guess.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ray, bring me the dagger.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Everyone looks surprised for a few seconds.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You sure?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet just nods.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: While he goes to retrieve the dagger, Scarlet places a hand on Seth's shoulder.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Seth, I need you to be in Charge of everything. I know you are fit for
      this position anyways.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I understand.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And Lu, you try to help him out as much as you can, okay? Especially when
      he starts bickering with Ray.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Okay\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7b8c9d0e1f2031445566778899aabbc, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Good.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ray returns with a dagger looking a bit unsure.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It's a pretty dagger. The handle is shaped like a snake head with red gemstones
      as its eyes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You're not going to repeat the past, right?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet takes the dagger and grips it tightly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, we're going there to change it. Don't worry, this is just in case.
      I plan to not use it at all, if possible.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Is that\u2026?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, it's the weapon I used to kill Prince Amon.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's what I suspected. I'm all for a little extra protection, though
      I really hope she won't have to resort to that with me being by her side.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Then, let's be on our way.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Okay.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I nod and we say our goodbyes to the others.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take Scarlet's hand.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ready?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ready when you are.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 16dfa76dbb94f464989ce1c99d3fd82e, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d062a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e76, type: 2}
